# AINav Control Plane — Cursor project rules

## Identity
- Company: AINav, Inc.
- Public edge: AINav.Institute
- Product: AINav Control Plane
- Job C only: effect authority (dual admit + DecisionRecords) before privileged SoR writes
- Not Job A inventory; not Job B IdP replacement; complement Agent 365 / Okta / Zenity

## Naming
- Never lead with Aether as a product brand
- SOW / contracts: AINav, Inc.
- Pin / verify: AINav.Institute

## Pin edge (Azure)
- Deploy static tree: mothership/www → Azure Static Web Apps
- Script: mothership/azure/deploy-swa.sh
- CI: .github/workflows/azure-static-web-apps.yml (secret AZURE_STATIC_WEB_APPS_API_TOKEN)
- LIVE_PIN_OK: https://ainav.institute/health.json is JSON with policy_digest (not Squarespace HTML)
- DNS: Cloudflare already resolves the domain; remove Squarespace targets; point at SWA per Azure custom-domain instructions
- See docs/DNS_PROPAGATION_TROUBLESHOOTING.md and docs/DO_THESE_NOW.md

## Admit plane
- Dual: named distinct principals, action_hash triple bind, single-use, fail-closed
- Single-host atomic via AdmitLock (lab fixtures)
- Multi-host: agent_gov.redis_consume.RedisDualConsume + scripts/redis/dual_consume.lua
- Claim HA only after Redis fixtures green
- Gold spine: docs/GOLD_STANDARD.md · docs/BEST_OF_INTEGRATED.md · scripts/check_gold_standard.py · make gold
- Website serves the pin — does not admit
- One-shot path: DualSession.run_and_apply / AdmitClient.admit_and_apply
- Offline dual predicates: agent_gov.lua_simulator

## U-DUAL + Redis
- Pack: U-DUAL $20–35k/yr — never free with P-ADM or U-SOR
- Atomic burn: docs/U_DUAL_REDIS_ATOMIC.md
- Keys: ainav:req:{request_id}, ainav:tok:{request_id}:{token_id}
- Script: validate-all-then-write-all; {ok}|{err}; NOSCRIPT → LOAD once
- Cursor rule: .cursor/rules/redis-lua-dual-admit.mdc

## Commercial
- Land: FIRST_OFFER L1 $28/35/40k fixtures-first
- Attach: P-ADM $40–60k/yr within ~90 days of green L1
- Script: docs/P_ADM_ATTACH_SCRIPT.md · playbook: docs/P_ADM_ATTACH_PLAYBOOK.md
- Ops three: docs/COMMERCIAL_OPS_THREE.md
  - Availability/ACL: docs/COMMERCIAL_AVAILABILITY_AND_ENTITLEMENT.md
  - Sales/purchase: docs/SALES_PURCHASE_PROCESS.md
  - Implementation/upsells: docs/IMPLEMENTATION_AND_UPSELL_INTEGRATION.md
- No fail-open discounts; no inventory SKUs; no free U-DUAL

## Success equation
SUCCESS = LIVE_PIN_OK × proof day × signed L1 FIRST_OFFER × P-ADM attach

## Azure pin edge (ops)
- Health: /healthz.json (probe) + /health.json (LIVE_PIN_OK digest)
- Check: python3 scripts/check_azure_swa_health.py --local|--public --require-live
- Catalog: mothership/azure/README.md
- FD probe 30s on /healthz.json; alerts on OriginHealthPercentage + OriginLatency
- LAW: configure-log-analytics-diagnostics.sh; KQL summary/fast only by default
- Cursor rule: .cursor/rules/azure-pin-edge.mdc

## Model cutover
- On Grok version change: docs/MODEL_CUTOVER.md — re-run make gold; do not soften dual/SKUs
- Repo truth > chat memory

# Must-have offering: docs/MUST_HAVE_OFFERING.md · docs/OFFERING.md · L1 then P-ADM only
